@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: text/plain

###

### 2. List All Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. List Units for Length Category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories/length/units
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. List Units for Temperature Category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories/temperature/units
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. List Units for Weight / Mass Category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories/weight/units
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Convert Length: Meter to Foot (Functional Requirement Example)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "category": "length",
  "fromUnit": "meter",
  "toUnit": "foot",
  "value": 10
}

###

### 7. Convert Length Using Symbols (Case-Insensitive)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "category": "length",
  "fromUnit": "m",
  "toUnit": "ft",
  "value": 10
}

###

### 8. Convert Temperature: Celsius to Fahrenheit
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "category": "temperature",
  "fromUnit": "celsius",
  "toUnit": "fahrenheit",
  "value": 100
}

###

### 9. Convert Temperature: Absolute Zero (0 Kelvin to Celsius)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "category": "temperature",
  "fromUnit": "kelvin",
  "toUnit": "celsius",
  "value": 0
}

###

### 10. Convert Weight: Kilogram to Pound
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "category": "weight",
  "fromUnit": "kilogram",
  "toUnit": "pound",
  "value": 10
}

###

### 11. Custom Precision Rounding (2 decimal places)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "category": "length",
  "fromUnit": "meter",
  "toUnit": "foot",
  "value": 10,
  "precision": 2
}

###

### 12. Error: Unknown Category (Expects 404 ProblemDetails)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "category": "speed",
  "fromUnit": "mph",
  "toUnit": "kph",
  "value": 65
}

###

### 13. Error: Unknown Unit in Category (Expects 400 ProblemDetails)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "category": "length",
  "fromUnit": "celsius",
  "toUnit": "meter",
  "value": 10
}

###

### 14. Error: Value Below Absolute Zero (Expects 400 ProblemDetails)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "category": "temperature",
  "fromUnit": "celsius",
  "toUnit": "kelvin",
  "value": -300
}
